# 18. What if Control Plane Fails?

Agar Control Plane temporarily unavailable ho jaye:

```text
Control Plane ❌
Workers       ✅
```

Existing Pods generally worker nodes par run karte reh sakte hain.

Lekin cluster management affected hoga:

* New workloads schedule nahi honge
* Normal reconciliation affected hogi
* New API operations fail ho sakte hain
* Scaling/self-healing control-plane actions affected ho sakte hain

Isliye production mein **HA Control Plane** important hai.

Typical HA setup:

```text
        Load Balancer
             |
    +--------+--------+
    |        |        |
 Master-1 Master-2 Master-3
    |        |        |
    +--------+--------+
             |
       Worker Nodes
```

