# 19. Kubernetes Troubleshooting

Basic troubleshooting flow:

```text
Problem
   ↓
kubectl get
   ↓
kubectl describe
   ↓
kubectl logs
   ↓
Check Events
   ↓
Check Service
   ↓
Check DNS
   ↓
Check Network
   ↓
Check Node
   ↓
Check Resources
```

Useful commands:

```bash
kubectl get pods
kubectl describe pod <pod>
kubectl logs <pod>
kubectl logs <pod> --previous
kubectl get events
kubectl get nodes
kubectl describe node <node>
kubectl get svc
kubectl get endpoints
kubectl get deployment
```

Common issues:

```text
CrashLoopBackOff
ImagePullBackOff
ErrImagePull
Pending
OOMKilled
ContainerCreating
```

---

# 20. Kubernetes Backup & DR

Self-managed Kubernetes:

```text
ETCD
 ↓
Snapshot
 ↓
Remote Backup Storage
```

Application resources aur persistent volumes ke liye **Velero** jaise tools use kiye ja sakte hain.

Infrastructure ko reproducible banane ke liye:

* Terraform
* Ansible
* Git
* GitOps

use kiye ja sakte hain.

