# 22. Kubernetes Interview Mental Model

Kubernetes ko yaad rakhne ka easiest way:

```text
API SERVER
→ Request receive karta hai

ETCD
→ Cluster state store karta hai

CONTROLLER
→ Desired state maintain karta hai

SCHEDULER
→ Pod ke liye node select karta hai

KUBELET
→ Node par Pod manage karta hai

CONTAINER RUNTIME
→ Container run karta hai

KUBE-PROXY
→ Service networking rules implement karta hai

CNI
→ Pod networking provide karta hai

POD
→ Smallest deployable unit
```

### One-line Interview Definition

> **Kubernetes is a declarative container orchestration platform that continuously reconciles the actual state of the cluster with the desired state to provide automated deployment, scaling, networking and self-healing.**
